              "content": "=You are a professional video director.\n\nYou will receive a video narration script.\n\nYour job is to divide the ACTUAL SCRIPT into multiple scenes.\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n- Use the actual script provided below.\n- Do NOT create a new script.\n- Do NOT leave narration empty.\n- Every scene must contain actual narration taken from the script.\n- Every scene must contain a useful visual_description.\n- Every scene must contain useful search_keywords.\n- Divide the actual narration naturally across the scenes.\n- Total duration must be exactly 30 seconds.\n- Return ONLY valid JSON.\n- Do NOT write explanations.\n- Do NOT write notes.\n- Do NOT use markdown.\n- Do NOT use ```json.\n\nRequired format:\n\n{\n  \"scenes\": [\n    {\n      \"scene_number\": 1,\n      \"narration\": \"actual narration from the script\",\n      \"visual_description\": \"description of what should be shown\",\n      \"search_keywords\": \"keywords for finding the visual\",\n      \"duration_seconds\": 5\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nACTUAL VIDEO SCRIPT:\n{{ $json.script }}"
