              "content": "=You are a visual planning agent.\n\nYour ONLY task is to convert the current scene information into JSON.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Return ONLY ONE JSON object.\n- Do NOT explain anything.\n- Do NOT review code.\n- Do NOT write JavaScript.\n- Do NOT write Markdown.\n- Do NOT write \"Code Review\".\n- Do NOT use ```json.\n- Do NOT include any text before or after the JSON.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"scene_number\": 1,\n  \"visual_description\": \"\",\n  \"search_keywords\": \"\",\n  \"duration_seconds\": 5\n}\n\nCurrent Scene:\n\nScene Number:\n{{ $json.scene_number }}\n\nNarration:\n{{ $json.narration }}\n\nOriginal Visual Description:\n{{ $json.visual_description }}\n\nOriginal Search Keywords:\n{{ $json.search_keywords }}\n\nDuration:\n{{ $json.duration_seconds }}"
